      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat eggs together in a large bowl; stir in evaporated milk, brown sugar, cinnamon, and nutmeg. Pour egg mixture over apple mixture. Cover the slow cooker.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
